      "title": "American SI Exports Program; On-Demand Consortia for Specific Foreign Opportunities",
      "url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/11/27/2026-24107/american-si-exports-program-on-demand-consortia-for-specific-foreign-opportunities",
      "date": "2026-11-27",
      "summary": "The Department of Commerce (the Department), through the International Trade Administration (ITA), establishes the On-Demand Consortia pathway under the Super Intelligence (SI) Exports Program \\1\\ (the Program) authorized by Executive Order 14320: Promoting the Export of the American SI Technology Stack, as laid out in the Call for Proposals for Pre-Set Consortia, released on April 10, 2026 (April 2026 CFP). The Department also provides for re-designation and de- designation of packages designated under the April 2026 CFP or this notice and for the Pre-Set Consortia pathway to reopen at a later date. ---------------------------------------------------------------------------",
